 escalated into a cascade of debilitating symptoms, including heart inflammation, joint pain, muscle spasms, and episodes of passing out. As his health deteriorated, his once vibrant life was overshadowed by pain, uncertainty, and frustration. We will discuss Heiko’s arduous journey through numerous hospital visits, medical tests, and consultations with healthcare professionals. Ultimately, Heiko’s search for a diagnosis lead him to an esteemed immunologist and an emerging understanding of vaccine-induced autoimmunity and its implications for individuals like Heiko. Join us for this emotional and important discussion and as always, share this link and bring some friends!\nSupport the work of VSRF at https://VacSafety.org/donate\nDonations are tax deductible and we need your support to continue our work into 2024. Or to text-to-donate, text LIBERTY to 53555 Show less", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/s8/1/m/Y/D/0/mYD0t.qR4e-small-VSRF-Live-147-C19-Vaccine-I.jpg", "display_id": "v5fpx5o", "fulltitle": "VSRF Live #147: C19 Vaccine Injury and Athletes: A Discussion with Heiko Sepp", "duration_string": "1:41:23", "upload_date": "20241008", "release_date": "20241010", "release_year": 2024, "is_live": false, "was_live": true, "epoch": 1777717598, "url": "https://1a-1791.com/video/s8/2/m/Y/D/0/mYD0t.aaa.rec.mp4", "format_id": "mp4-1080p-1", "fps": 30, "tbr": 4743, "filesize": 3607308531, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "protocol": "https", "ext": "mp4", "video_ext": "mp4", "audio_ext": "none", "resolution": "1920x1080", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "aspect_ratio": 1.78, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/140.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate"}, "format": "mp4-1080p-1 - 1920x1080", "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.01.31", "release_git_head": "9a9a